<!-- §06 — RESULTS -->
<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Results</div>
<h2>Consistent Gains Across Frontier Models</h2>
<p>
  The PDR+RTV pipeline improves every frontier model on every benchmark tested. On SWE-Bench Verified (500 real GitHub issues), gains range from +4.4pp to +8.4pp. On Terminal-Bench v2.0 (long-horizon terminal tasks), gains are even larger: +7.3pp to +16.2pp. The larger gains on Terminal-Bench reflect both higher variance in those tasks and the greater importance of good rollout selection when trajectories are longer.
</p>

